{
  "name": "ron-harris",
  "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-tts",
  "totalSeconds": 73.384,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "01",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t01",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "What if the man who checks the slot machines is the one rigging them?",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ron-harris/01.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.422,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "ce1cc48d78b9"
    },
    {
      "id": "02",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "In the early nineties, Ron Harris was a computer expert at Nevada's Gaming Control Board.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ron-harris/02.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.256,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "515a81331799"
    },
    {
      "id": "03",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "His job was to find cheating software hidden in casino games.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ron-harris/03.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.913,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "515a81331799"
    },
    {
      "id": "04",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Agents checked slot machines by plugging in a laptop.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ron-harris/04.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.716,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "6d33592edb54"
    },
    {
      "id": "05",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Harris wrote the program on those laptops.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ron-harris/05.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.689,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "6d33592edb54"
    },
    {
      "id": "06",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "And he hid something inside it.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ron-harris/06.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.415,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "6d33592edb54"
    },
    {
      "id": "07",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Every time an agent tested a machine, the program quietly changed it.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ron-harris/07.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.909,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "af0ef08c0b4a"
    },
    {
      "id": "08",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Now it paid a jackpot when coins went in a set order.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ron-harris/08.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.828,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "af0ef08c0b4a"
    },
    {
      "id": "09",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "Only Harris and his friends knew the order.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ron-harris/09.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.959,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "af0ef08c0b4a"
    },
    {
      "id": "10",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "His friends hit jackpots in Las Vegas, Reno and Lake Tahoe.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ron-harris/10.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.302,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "7e7782d63d50"
    },
    {
      "id": "11",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Prosecutors could prove at least forty-two thousand dollars.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ron-harris/11.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.084,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "7e7782d63d50"
    },
    {
      "id": "12",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "Nobody knows the real total.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ron-harris/12.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.301,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "7e7782d63d50"
    },
    {
      "id": "13",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Then he went further.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ron-harris/13.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 0.861,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "f9430b95ed5c"
    },
    {
      "id": "14",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "He built a program that predicted keno numbers without touching the machine at all.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ron-harris/14.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.73,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "f9430b95ed5c"
    },
    {
      "id": "15",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "In Las Vegas, he and a partner took ten thousand dollars from a keno machine in under five minutes.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ron-harris/15.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 5.149,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "f9430b95ed5c"
    },
    {
      "id": "16",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "So in January nineteen ninety-five, they flew to Atlantic City.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ron-harris/16.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.123,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "9d07ddc7a5b8"
    },
    {
      "id": "17",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "The partner bought keno tickets at Bally's.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ron-harris/17.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.187,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "9d07ddc7a5b8"
    },
    {
      "id": "18",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t07b",
      "gapAfter": 0.8,
      "text": "One ticket hit: a hundred thousand dollars.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ron-harris/18.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.368,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "33e12b711bfe"
    },
    {
      "id": "19",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t08a",
      "gapAfter": 0.8,
      "text": "And that's what sank them.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ron-harris/19.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.285,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "f59f333a1b4d"
    },
    {
      "id": "20",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t08",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "A win that big made the casino suspicious.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ron-harris/20.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.532,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "3dac1c8b5e21"
    },
    {
      "id": "21",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t08",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Before a cent was paid, the partner was arrested.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ron-harris/21.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.573,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "3dac1c8b5e21"
    },
    {
      "id": "22",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t08",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Harris was picked up when his plane landed in Las Vegas.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ron-harris/22.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.964,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "3dac1c8b5e21"
    },
    {
      "id": "23",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t08",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "The judge gave him seven years.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ron-harris/23.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.723,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "3dac1c8b5e21"
    },
    {
      "id": "24",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t08",
      "gapAfter": 0.8,
      "text": "\"The depth of your betrayal,\" he said, \"was complete.\"",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ron-harris/24.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.748,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "3dac1c8b5e21"
    },
    {
      "id": "25",
      "scene": "s9",
      "take": "t09",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Today, Harris is in Nevada's Black Book, banned from the casinos he once inspected.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ron-harris/25.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.031,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "4d52a865cd27"
    },
    {
      "id": "26",
      "scene": "s9",
      "take": "t09",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "So who checks the people checking the machines?",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/ron-harris/26.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.316,
      "tempo": 1.02,
      "hash": "4d52a865cd27"
    }
  ]
}
